# Vibe Forge
# Temporary tooling used during forge-lab development. All contents stay
# out of git; task bookkeeping lives on disk only. Once the personality
# port is complete, _vibe-forge/ gets removed entirely and we spawn agents
# directly from forge-lab itself.
_vibe-forge/

# Deploy secrets (keep .gitkeep, ignore actual secrets)
deploy/secrets/*
!deploy/secrets/.gitkeep
cookies.txt
